`mcp_mcp_router_webSearch` (DuckDuckGo). Use MCP router for all external tool queries.\", \"Model naming fix: Use colons (`:`) not slashes (`/`) for Ollama models. Set model_catalog.enabled=false in config.yaml to prevent automatic conversion of `:` to `/` in model names.\", \".hermes directory is a git repo. Before modifying .hermes files, check if tracked with `git ls-files`. If not tracked and config-related, add to repo first. Commit changes after successful modifications.\", \"AgentMemory Hermes Integration Rules:\\n1. Secret Resolution: Native plugins MUST robustly load `AGENTMEMORY_SECRET` from `~/.agentmemory/.env` as ...","status":"ok","task_id":"9ec803cceb4f","tool_call_id":"call_85052b9f793d475a973402ef","tool_name":"memory","turn_id":"9ec803cceb4f:9ec803cceb4f:9f13ba95"},"sessionId":"9ec803cceb4f","timestamp":"2026-06-17T20:41:15.972739+00:00"},"type":"raw"}}␀³Š␀␀LÝÿÿ